meta {
  name: deactivate teacher
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

delete {
  url: {{base_url}}/administrator/teachers/:id/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Deactivates rather than deletes: sets `active` and `accepting_students` to
  false. Sessions reference the teacher with `PROTECT`, so a real delete would be
  refused anyway.

  A deactivated teacher disappears from the public lists and from every booking
  picker, but their past classes and the history on them stay intact.
  `PATCH {"active": true}` brings them back.

  Classes already booked with them are **not** cancelled -- reassign or cancel
  those from the sessions list.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Teacher deactivated."
  }
}
